abstract: >
  Unity Equilibrium Theory (UET) is a research repository that combines theory notes,
  numerical experiments, and documentation across multiple physics and engineering
  topics. This citation entry describes the repository release and its documentation
  framework; individual scientific claims should be evaluated topic by topic using the
  associated methods, data, and verification records.
